## 错误处理标准模式

### 基础模式
```javascript
async handleAction() {
  try {
    this.loading = true
    await this.validateForm()
    const result = await api.action(this.data)
    this.$message.success('操作成功')
    this.$emit('success', result)
  } catch (error) {
    this.handleError(error)
  } finally {
    this.loading = false
  }
}
```

